menu "AI Passport BSP"
    config BSP_LVGL_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "LVGL task stack size in bytes"
        range 7168 32768
        default 16384
        help
            Nested layout containers increase the recursive LVGL drawing stack.
            The OpenSwiftUI List demo exceeds the port's 7168-byte default.

    config BSP_USB_MIRRORING_ENABLED
        bool "Enable USB display mirroring"
        default y
        help
            Retains a bounded RGB565 row queue and a transmission task for
            development-time screen mirroring.
endmenu
